{"id":"P059-1","subject":"P","unit":"P059","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.10.19 한국전력공사 (휴노)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P059-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.10.19 한국전력공사 (휴노) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n대전 도체의 표면전하밀도는 도체 표면의 모양에 따라\n\n어떻게 분포하는가?\n\n\n① 도체의 곡률반경이 클수록 표면전하밀도가 크다.\n\n② 도체의 곡률이 클수록 표면전하밀도가 크다.\n\n③ 도체의 표면전하밀도는 표면의 모양과 무관하다.\n\n④ 평면의 표면전하밀도가 가장 크다.\n\n⑤ 구도체의 표면전하밀도가 가장 크다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국전력공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e18-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e18-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e18-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1552}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P059-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.10.19 한국전력공사 (휴노) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n무한직선도체 중심으로부터 10cm 떨어진 지점의 자계는\n\n40cm 떨어진 지점의 자계의 몇 배인가?\n\n\n① 배         ② 배                               \n\n③ 배          ④ 배\n\n⑤ 배","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국전력공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e18-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e18-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":554},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e18-m02-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1283}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P059-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.10.19 한국전력공사 (휴노) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n그림과 같은 환상 솔레노이드가 있을 때, P점에서의\n\n자계의 세기는 몇 ATm인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n                 \n①            ②        \n\n                         \n③              ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국전력공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e18-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e18-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":719},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e18-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":552}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P059-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.10.19 한국전력공사 (휴노) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n전력계통에 태양광 발전시스템을 연계하는 경우, 전력품질\n\n의 고려사항에 해당하지 않는 것은?\n\n\n① 직류 유입제한     ② 플리커\n\n③ 역률         ④ 고조파\n\n⑤ 노이즈","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국전력공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e18-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e18-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e18-m04-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1291}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P059-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.10.19 한국전력공사 (휴노) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n4단자 정수 , , , 를 이용한 전력방정식의 표현\n\n으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n①     ② \n         \n③     ④ \n         \n⑤ \n  ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국전력공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e18-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e18-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":633},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e18-m05-e1.webp","width":678,"height":591}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P059-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.10.19 한국전력공사 (휴노) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n높이가 m이고, 수평장력 kg을 받는 전주에 지선을\n설치할 때, 지선장력 는 몇 kg인가?\n\n(단, 지선의 길이는 m이다.)\n\n\n   ×           × \n①            ②  \n\n   ×           × \n③            ④  \n\n   × \n⑤","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국전력공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e18-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e18-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":640},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e18-m06-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P059-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.10.19 한국전력공사 (휴노) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\nBLDC모터와 Brushed DC(BDC)모터를 비교할 때, 옳지\n\n않은 것은?\n\n\n① BLDC모터가 BDC보다 소음이 더 작다.\n\n② BLDC모터가 BDC보다 출력밀도가 높다.\n\n③ BLDC모터가 BDC보다 고속도에 적합하지 않다.\n\n④ BLDC모터가 BDC보다 가격이 비싸다.\n\n⑤ BLDC모터가 BDC보다 소형, 경량화가 가능